          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"A clear gust-forces-tether solution delivers the message, with a concrete ending; the unexplained “knot condition” and repetitive procedural phrasing weaken the prose.\"},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":4,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"The gentle-wind high-flight route works and ends clearly, but calling the kite's “sound condition” a problem never leads to a diagnosis or repair.\"},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Mina identifies and fixes the unstable tail, then uses the gentle wind for a successful flight; the sky-loop image gives the familiar resolution some charm.\"},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"A bowed frame is repaired and gusts consequentially require the low tether route; the sequence is sound, though the repair happens later than the route decision.\"},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The frame repair, lightened message, gentle-weather choice, and successful flight form a complete, child-readable problem-solving arc.\"},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The gusts force a safe tether plan while Mina repairs the whipping tail, and the tube reaches the basket securely; its repeated stock wording makes it feel mechanical.\"},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":4,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"The gusty-weather tether solution is coherent, but the stated “sound condition” is never explained or addressed, leaving a conspicuous dangling problem.\"},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Gusts redirect the delivery to a tether while Mina straightens the bowed frame, producing a clear safe arrival despite formulaic language.\"},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":4,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"The message reaches the basket through a sensible tether route, but the kite's unspecified “sound condition” is introduced and then abandoned.\"},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Mina lightens the note, repairs the frame, and adapts to gusts with a tether; the secure tube in the basket provides a complete concrete finish.\"}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":1,\"causal_path\":3,\"ending\":0,\"language\":2,\"overall\":2},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All ten stories share the same rooftop message-delivery premise and identical success ending: Orra finds the tube in the marked basket. The meaningful branch is only route choice—gentle wind enables high flight in s000057, s000047, and s000034, while gusts require a tether in the others—along with minor repair substitutions; several stories retain an unresolved “sound condition” (s000057, s000068, s000005). This sample does not establish diversity for the full generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"story_ids\":[\"s000057\",\"s000047\",\"s000034\"],\"summary\":\"Gentle wind permits a repaired/prepared kite to fly high and carry the message directly to the basket.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000029\",\"s000073\",\"s000043\",\"s000068\",\"s000096\",\"s000005\",\"s000085\"],\"summary\":\"Gusty wind rules out high flight, so Mina prepares the message and uses a short tether to deliver it safely to the basket.\"}]}",
